    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Timeloop Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/4a7ef129ca2d4ba233e04ab76815e152.poster.avif?t=1753388086\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/4a7ef129ca2d4ba233e04ab76815e152.webm?t=1753388086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/4a7ef129ca2d4ba233e04ab76815e152.mp4?t=1753388086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some areas in Timebound are enchanted with timeloop magic. After a few steps, you're sent back to where you entered. Use these simple rules and see just how far they can take you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn the Rules... and Break Them</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/2b5d5174463808e11ddc404010121a5f.poster.avif?t=1753388086\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/2b5d5174463808e11ddc404010121a5f.webm?t=1753388086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/2b5d5174463808e11ddc404010121a5f.mp4?t=1753388086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle is handcrafted to teach you something new. There's no filler or chores, no hand-holding. It's a metroidbrainia and a rule-discovery game, so you will need to figure it out on your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover What's Hidden In Plain Sight </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/31da27703cab32b0e9dd15e19ecc60e6.poster.avif?t=1753388086\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/31da27703cab32b0e9dd15e19ecc60e6.webm?t=1753388086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/31da27703cab32b0e9dd15e19ecc60e6.mp4?t=1753388086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is deeply interconnected - your progress is only limited by your knowledge of the game\u2019s systems, not by artificial unlocks. What seemed impossible before might just need a second look. Yes, you could have done that the entire time!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Puzzle Design</strong> -  Solve puzzles by manipulating local timeloops in creative ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knowledge-based Progression </strong> - Explore an open world where your only limit is what you know.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets &amp; meta puzzles</strong> - Think outside the box to solve layered, interconnected puzzles. </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Timeloop Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/4a7ef129ca2d4ba233e04ab76815e152.poster.avif?t=1753388086\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/4a7ef129ca2d4ba233e04ab76815e152.webm?t=1753388086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/4a7ef129ca2d4ba233e04ab76815e152.mp4?t=1753388086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some areas in Timebound are enchanted with timeloop magic. After a few steps, you're sent back to where you entered. Use these simple rules and see just how far they can take you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn the Rules... and Break Them</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/2b5d5174463808e11ddc404010121a5f.poster.avif?t=1753388086\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/2b5d5174463808e11ddc404010121a5f.webm?t=1753388086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/2b5d5174463808e11ddc404010121a5f.mp4?t=1753388086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle is handcrafted to teach you something new. There's no filler or chores, no hand-holding. It's a metroidbrainia and a rule-discovery game, so you will need to figure it out on your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover What's Hidden In Plain Sight </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/31da27703cab32b0e9dd15e19ecc60e6.poster.avif?t=1753388086\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/31da27703cab32b0e9dd15e19ecc60e6.webm?t=1753388086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/31da27703cab32b0e9dd15e19ecc60e6.mp4?t=1753388086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is deeply interconnected - your progress is only limited by your knowledge of the game\u2019s systems, not by artificial unlocks. What seemed impossible before might just need a second look. Yes, you could have done that the entire time!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Puzzle Design</strong> -  Solve puzzles by manipulating local timeloops in creative ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knowledge-based Progression </strong> - Explore an open world where your only limit is what you know.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets &amp; meta puzzles</strong> - Think outside the box to solve layered, interconnected puzzles. </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "An exploration puzzle adventure taking place in mystical ruins. Solve timeloop puzzles, explore the open world, learn the rules and break them.",
